{"id":"00364","root":"uni00364_1","name":{"ja":"リーナ","en":"Lina"},"title":{"ja":"【サマーストーム】","en":"【Summer Storm】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【サマーストーム】 リーナ","en":"【Summer Storm】 Lina"},"aliases":["Leena"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Nomad"],"release":"2020-07-31","limited":false,"characterId":21,"profile":{"ja":"ノマドの騎士軍に所属する騎士。イングリッドなど一流の魔界騎士にはまだまだ及ばないが、日々の鍛錬と実戦により彼女自身の力が目覚めつつあり、日増しに強くなっていっている。リーナはいくつもの戦場を駆け勝利を収めていくうちに、イングリッドたちの目にも止まり、その風を操る力から『嵐騎』の二つ名を授かった。魔界騎士といえど夏は暑い。ということでノマドの魔界騎士達も衣替えを始めた。リーナは「魔界騎士たる者、心頭滅却すれば火もまた涼し」といつもの服を着崩さずに頑張っていたが、仲間達は「折角だからお洒落な夏服を着せよう」と企み、半ば強引にリーナを着替えさせてしまう。普段とは雰囲気の違う服装のリーナに仲間達は「可愛い」と盛り上がる。リーナ自身は自分らしくないと思って元の服に戻りたがっていたが、たまたま通り掛かったイングリッドが「衣替えか……必要だな」と呟くのを聞き、着替えるに着替えられなくなってしまった。","en":"(Lina, she/her) A knight serving in the Nomad Knight Corps. Though she has yet to match the elite demon-realm knights like Ingrid, daily training and combat are awakening her own power, and she grows stronger each day. As Lina triumphs on numerous battlefields, she catches the eyes of knights such as Ingrid, who bestow upon her the epithet \"Storm Rider\" for her wind-manipulating abilities. Even demon-realm knights suffer in the summer heat, so the Nomad knights have begun changing into summer attire. Lina clings to her usual clothes, proclaiming, \"A demon-realm knight who clears his mind can feel even fire as cool,\" but her comrades scheme, \"Let's dress her in something stylish for summer,\" and half-force her into a new outfit. The change draws cheers of \"Cute!\" from her peers. Lina, feeling uncharacteristic, wants to revert to her original clothes, but when Ingrid passes by and mutters, \"A wardrobe change… it's necessary,\" she finds herself unable to swap back."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"烏丸そら","forms":[{"id":"uni00364_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[812,1624],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[128,256],"def":[84,168],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","700009"]},{"id":"uni00364_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1224,2448],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[206,412],"def":[118,236],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","700009","700010"]},{"id":"uni00364_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1636,3273],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[284,569],"def":[152,305],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","700009","700010"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"700009":{"slot":"skill1","id":700009,"name":{"ja":"テイルウィンド"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All allies: SPD +20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_up","tag":"buff"}]},"700010":{"slot":"skill2","id":700010,"name":{"ja":"サマーストーム"},"hits":3,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 450% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 453% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 457% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 461% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 465% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down","tag":"debuff"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"夏服の嵐騎士"},"detail":{"ja":"部隊全体の石化耐性値を超特大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"All allies: Petrification resistance +100","icon":"abnormality_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":2,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00001",160],[1,"blo00004",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00001",320],[12,"blo00004",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00001",320],[26,"blo00004",1],[27,"blo00007",5],[27,"blo00010",5],[27,"blo00013",5],[28,"blo00007",5],[28,"blo00010",5],[28,"blo00013",5],[29,"blo00007",5],[29,"blo00010",5],[29,"blo00013",5],[30,"blo00007",5],[30,"blo00010",5],[30,"blo00013",5],[31,"blo00001",320],[31,"blo00004",2],[32,"blo00007",5],[32,"blo00010",5],[32,"blo00013",5],[33,"blo00007",5],[33,"blo00010",5],[33,"blo00013",5],[34,"blo00007",5],[34,"blo00010",5],[34,"blo00013",5],[35,"blo00007",5],[35,"blo00010",5],[35,"blo00013",5],[36,"blo00001",320],[36,"blo00004",2],[37,"blo00007",5],[37,"blo00010",5],[37,"blo00013",5],[38,"blo00007",5],[38,"blo00010",5],[38,"blo00013",5],[39,"blo00007",5],[39,"blo00010",5],[39,"blo00013",5],[40,"blo00007",5],[40,"blo00010",5],[40,"blo00013",5],[41,"blo00001",640],[41,"blo00004",2],[42,"blo00007",5],[42,"blo00010",5],[42,"blo00013",5],[43,"blo00007",5],[43,"blo00010",5],[43,"blo00013",5],[44,"blo00007",5],[44,"blo00010",5],[44,"blo00013",5],[45,"blo00007",5],[45,"blo00010",5],[45,"blo00013",5],[46,"blo00001",640],[46,"blo00004",2],[47,"blo00007",5],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00010",5],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00013",5],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00007",5],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00010",5],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00013",5],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00007",5],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00010",5],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"お、おおお、おまたせー……うぅっ、なにを笑っている！　この嵐騎のリーナにこんな格好をさせて、ただで済むと思うなよっ……","en":"S-sorry to keep you waiting... ugh, why are you laughing! You think making me, Lina the Storm Rider, wear this will be free, huh?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"……言っておくけど、これが私服じゃないからな！　ほかの女子にコーディネートされただけで……普段はもっと、ラフな格好なんだ！","en":"...Just so you know, this isn't my everyday clothes! It's only because other girls coordinated it... normally I wear something much more relaxed!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"はぁ、落ち着かん……なに？　普段のミニスカートは、恥ずかしくないのかって……なにを言っている、あの動きやすさは騎士に相応しいだろう？","en":"Ha, I can't calm down... what? You think my usual miniskirt is embarrassing... what are you saying, that mobility is fitting for a knight?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"私はもっと、クールでスタイリッシュな服が好きなんだ。こういう、がーりー？な服だと、妙に顔が熱くなるというか……うぅ～っ！","en":"I prefer cooler, stylish outfits. Wearing something garish like this makes my face weirdly hot... ugh!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"どうせ着るなら、イングリッド様みたいな服がよかったぞ……あの襟の高いマントといい、すごく格好いいからな！","en":"If I had a choice, I'd wear something like Ingrid-sama's—those high-collared capes are so cool!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"遅いぞ！　こんなところに、一人で置き去りにするなんて……変な男たちがひっきりなしに、一人か一人かって、死ぬほどうるさかったんだぞ！","en":"You're late! Leaving me alone in a place like this... those weird men kept coming, one after another, it was so noisy it could kill!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"お、おーい、待ったぁー？　きょ、今日のデート、た、たのしみだなー……って、なにをやらせるんだ！　くそぉっ、からかいやがってぇ……","en":"H-hey, wait—today's date, I'm looking forward to it... what are you making me do! Damn, stop teasing me..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"……な、なぁ？　本当に……似合ってる、のか？　そ、そうか……まぁ、えっと……たまにだったら、着てやってもいいぞ！　たまにだったらな！","en":"...S-so? Does it really... suit me? I... well... um... if it's just occasional, I could wear it! Only occasionally!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"じ、自分で見せ付けるなんて……く、屈辱だ！　屈辱のはずなのに……か、身体が疼いて、な、何だコレ……","en":"T-to show it off myself... it's humiliating! It should be humiliating, but my body's tingling, what's this...?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00364_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"し、下着も可愛いのを渡されて……お、お漏らしだと！？　このシミはあいえ――な、何を言わせる！？","en":"Even my underwear's cute... w-was I wetting myself!? This stain—no, what are you making me say!?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00364_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"うう……だ、誰も見てないよな？　こ、こんなのお前にしか見せられないんだからな？　おい、なにをニヤニヤしてるんだ！","en":"Ugh... n-no one's watching, right? I can only show this to you... Hey, why are you smirking!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00364_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00364_1/uni00364_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0246_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0246a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"gacha","type":"Kessen","title":{"ja":"決戦ピックアップガチャ【魔性】","en":"Kessen Pick-up Gacha (Devilish)"},"start":"2025-05-01","end":"2025-05-31"},{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":30,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":true,"origin":"Permanent","art":{"graphicId":"uni_00364","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00364_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0246"}}